Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:23:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] MoE: shared expert on a side stream
 (EXL3_MOE_SHARED_SIDE); DGEMV per-device workspace

The shared expert runs on a high-priority side stream and joins before the routed down projection. Bit-identical; c1 +6 %, c8 +12 %. DGEMV now uses one small workspace per device (EXL3_DGEMV_WS_MB, default 4) instead of 64 MiB per (device, stream). Drops a DGEMV test assertion that measured torch's CUDA-graph pool rather than DGEMV.
